data: {"id": "31c7bf01c2434163-final", "run_id": "31c7bf01c2434163", "seq": 1864, "ts_ms": 1789123380045, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v05/workload` | ContainerCreating | Pod aiops-case-v05/workload 处于 ContainerCreating 状态且无法进入 Running |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `FailedMount`: configmap references non-existent config key: unavailable-key (发生19次) | 确认 ConfigMap 挂载失败直接原因 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `FailedMount`: Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input] (发生10次) | 确认 kubelet 挂载卷操作持续失败 |\n| 3 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason`: ContainerCreating (容器: app) | 确认应用容器处于阻塞等待状态 |\n| 4 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `pod.phase`: Pending | 确认 Pod 整体调度状态 |\n| 5 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | `container.resource_request.memory`: 8Mi; `resource_limit.memory`: 32Mi | 排除资源超限导致启动失败的可能 |\n| 6 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` 值为 1 (reason: ContainerCreating) | 独立验证容器处于 Waiting 状态 |\n\n**证据说明：**\n1-2 行 K8s 事件明确指出挂载卷失败是因为引用了不存在的 ConfigMap Key (`unavailable-key`)，直接导致 5 行的卷挂载报错。\n3-6 行的状态与指标相互印证，表明由于挂载失败，容器无法进入 Running 状态而长期卡在 ContainerCreating/Pending。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap 'workload-input' 缺少 Volume 引用的 Key 'unavailable-key' (证据 1) → \nKubelet 执行 MountVolume.SetUp 失败并报错 (证据 1, 2) → \nPod 容器状态被阻塞在 ContainerCreating (证据 3, 6) → \nPod 整体处于 Pending 状态且无法提供服务 (证据 4)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因：Pod 中名为 `input` 的 ConfigMap Volume 引用了不存在的 ConfigMap Key (`unavailable-key`) (证据 1, 2)。\n\n该错误导致 kubelet 无法完成挂载卷操作，使得应用容器 `app` 无法初始化，从而将 Pod 状态阻塞在 `ContainerCreating` / `Pending` 阶段 (证据 3-6)。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.2m\n├─ 问题定位: 28.2s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 35.1s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v05/workload: 35.1s (Evidence 27.6s, RCA 7.4s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 7.8s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v05/workload**: pod-imagepull-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed, pod-sandbox-create-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 71.146, "metrics": {"run_id": "31c7bf01c2434163", "mttr": {"value": "1.2m", "seconds": 71.15362930297852, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "54%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed, pod-sandbox-create-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.95, "weighted_score": 0.19, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 95%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 71153.62930297852, "llm_calls": 11, "llm_duration_ms": 68216.94707870483, "tool_calls": 12, "executed_tool_calls": 11, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 1, "successful_tool_calls": 12, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 6901.124715805054, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2634.0420246124268}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问